ind":"announcement","title":"We Pretend Demo Is Out!!","summary":"Version 1.1 is now live — the demo is officially out!After a long period of development, we’re excited to announce that the We Pretend demo is officially available to play.This first public demo includes the opening level of the game, allowing players to step into the first memory-space and experience the atmosphere, fixed-camera exploration, and psychological horror direction we are building for the full release.The first level is fully playable and includes three different endings depending on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T15:59:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689360-1842846814450639","game_id":"steam-4689360","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release Very Soon & Discord Server Reveal","summary":"After a long time in development, we’re excited to announce that the We Pretend demo will be releasing next week.This demo will act as an early look into the game’s world, atmosphere, and core experience. While it is not the final version, it will give players a chance to explore what we’ve been building, experience the opening parts of the game, and get a better understanding of the direction we are taking with the full release.Because the demo is still part of active development, feedback will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T12:22:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450639","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4689360-1838407329254576","game_id":"steam-4689360","kind":"announcement","title":"We Pretend New Cinematic/Gameplay Trailer!!!","summar